* Neuron-array slots: one axon-hillock LIF + input synapse + two in-cell probe taps (+ gap trim).
* Layout: layout/slot/ (<cell>.mag / out/<cell>.gds), 28.0 x 43.5 um box (docs/06 Floorplan.md s4).
* Requires: neuron/membrane.spice, neuron/lif.spice, readout/readout.spice, neuron/synapse.spice,
*           trim/trim_gap.spice (include them first).
*
* Variants (same frame, pins and column lines; see layout/slot/README.md):
*   slot_ah    S slot: no trim.
*   slot_ah_h  H slot: + 4-bit Vth-EL gap trim (trim_gap4, bits t0..t3).
*   slot_ah_p  P slot: as slot_ah_h, but the leak OTA tail gate (and the gap-trim ladder gate, so the
*              gap-trim mV/step is unchanged) is the aux column line: per-column leak-tau trim from the
*              trim_tau4 cell in the strip below the array. el and vbn_leak feed through.
*              Cut path: build with P_AS_H=1 (layout/slot/build.sh) -> P positions use slot_ah_h.
*   slot_ah_f  F slot: as slot_ah, leak OTA tail XL.XMT W/L halved (1/4 instead of 2/4) on the same
*              vbn_leak line, so tau_F = 2 tau_S by geometry (NH EXP-46 "etch tau variants").
*   slot_cmp_h CMP slot: comparator LIF (det_cmp of lif_cmp, starve/tail on vbp_st) + 4-bit gap trim (t0..t3,
*              nibble 6). Since 2026-11-20 a DOUBLE slot (28 x 87 um, column 3, rows 0-1, the former dummy
*              slot's area): the trimmed version did not route in 28 x 43.5. The trimless fallback is kept
*              as slot_cmp_h_notrim. Its threshold vth_cmp arrives on the aux column line (array column 3:
*              there aux has no tau-trim cell, so the integrator connects B1's vth_cmp to column 3's aux).
*              vsrc feeds through.
*   slot_ah_50  AH50: as slot_ah with a 50 fF membrane (mcap 3.54 x 3.54).
*   slot_ah_400 AH400: as slot_ah_800 with mcap_r 7.07 x 9.6 (~270 fF; fits the 7.07 cap row), ~470 fF total (M2 array).
*   slot_ah_800 AH800: as slot_ah with 200 fF + ~540 fF (mcap_r 11.7 x 11.6 in the former trim space,
*              Metal1 vss shield over it) = ~740 fF; the hold switch moves into the main n-well.
*   slot_ref   REF slot (0,0): one prb_tap on el (sb = sub; PROBE_SUB = 3 -> row 0, column 0, sub = 1),
*              identical to the array taps, so it calibrates the whole tap + bus + pad path. No neuron.
*   slot_dummy DUMMY slot: slot_ah with no spike pin (spk internal) and both probe taps tied off
*              (en / sel / sb = vss). UNUSED since 2026-11-20: its slot (0,3) is the lower half of CMP.
*
* Ports (order of the .subckt line):
*   vm       membrane node
*   spk      spike output (to a Metal3 feed-through track -> control macro spk_in)
*   rsel     probe ROW select (shared by the 4 slots of a row; row Metal3 track)
*   sub      PROBE_SUB[0]   (shared row track): 1 = refractory-node tap vr
*   sub_b    ~PROBE_SUB[0]  (shared row track): 1 = membrane tap vm
*            The probe COLUMN select is the en column line (per column: en_c = PROBE_EN & col == c),
*            so a slot's tap reaches abus only when its row (rsel), its column (en) and sub agree.
*            This replaces the per-slot sel / sel_vr lines (8 row tracks -> 3).
*   el       leak reversal / resting voltage           (column line, shared)
*   vsrc     axon-hillock threshold knob (detector nfet source rail, shared)
*   vreset   reset voltage                             (column, shared)
*   vbn_leak leak OTA tail nfet gate bias              (column, shared; also the gap-trim DAC gate)
*   vbp_st   detector starve pfet gate bias            (column, shared)
*   vbn_ref  refractory discharge nfet gate bias       (column, shared)
*   vbn_prb  probe follower sink nfet gate bias        (column, shared)
*   en       probe column enable (3.3 V logic, per column line)
*   abus     analog probe bus (shared, to the pad driver)
*   vdd vss  supplies
*   aux      spare column line. slot_ah / slot_ah_h: feed-through. slot_ah_p: leak tail gate (tau trim).
*   vbp_syn  synapse weight pfet gate bias (NEW column line; p-IDAC into a 2/4 pmaster in the bias block)
*   sta stb hold mreset   rt_out[0..3] (3.3 V logic, shared by all slots; row Metal3 tracks)
*   t0..t3   gap-trim bits (slot_ah_h / slot_ah_p only; row Metal3 tracks from the trim latches)
*
* Contents: 200 fF mcap, leak OTA (leak_ota_degx = leak_ota_deg with its mirror node a brought out),
* AH detector (Cfb 8 fF), refractory (Cr 50 fF), probe taps on vm and vr (wf=4u lf=2u), syn_in.
* Change vs the week-1 lif_ah: the leak OTA output (vl) reaches vm through the hold switch XS.XHL
* (pfet, on while hold = 0); the OTA devices themselves are unchanged.
* Cfb is an ideal capacitor here; in layout it is a Metal1-Metal3 finger (MOM) capacitor, so the
* LVS reference (layout/slot/<cell>_lvs.spice) omits it and its value comes from PEX.

* prb_tap: in-cell probe follower (as readout/readout.spice prb_nsf) with a second series switch XSB,
* so the tap connects to abus only when sel (row select) AND sb (sub / sub_b) are high.
* XSC (2026-11-18): third series switch on the column select en. Without it, the taps of the other three
* columns in the selected row (sel = sb = 1, en = 0: sink off but the path on) still SOURCE current into
* abus through their followers, so abus read the max of the row: +65 mV with equal vm, up to +640 mV
* (sim/tb/tb_slot_probe_row.py). A drain-side enable was rejected: with the drain off the follower channel
* collapses and enabling kicks vm by +215 mV (50 fF floating) through the full gate-channel capacitance.
.subckt prb_tap vm abus en sel sb vbn_prb vdd vss wf=1u lf=0.5u
XMF vdd vm  prb vss nfet_03v3 W={wf} L={lf}
XME prb en  s   vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XMB s   vbn_prb vss vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=2u
XSC prb en  mc  vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSW mc  sel m   vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XSB m   sb  abus vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
.ends prb_tap

* leak_ota_deg with the mirror diode node a as a port (identical devices and names).
.subckt leak_ota_degx vm el a vbn vdd vss wi=4u li=1u wt=2u lt=4u wl=2u ll=4u wd=8u ld=1u
XMT  t   vbn vss vss nfet_03v3 W={wt} L={lt}
XM1  a   el  s1  vss nfet_03v3 W={wi} L={li}
XD1  s1  s1  t   vss nfet_03v3 W={wd} L={ld}
XM2  vm  vm  s2  vss nfet_03v3 W={wi} L={li}
XD2  s2  s2  t   vss nfet_03v3 W={wd} L={ld}
XP1  a   a   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W={wl} L={ll}
XP2  vm  a   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W={wl} L={ll}
.ends leak_ota_degx

.subckt slot_ah vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
* XPR (vr probe tap) dropped in M2 (MIL-95 item 5): XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_ah

.subckt slot_ah_h vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset t0 t1 t2 t3 cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
XT  la vm vbn_leak t0 t1 t2 t3 vdd vss trim_gap4
.ends slot_ah_h

.subckt slot_ah_p vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset t0 t1 t2 t3 cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la aux vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
XT  la vm aux t0 t1 t2 t3 vdd vss trim_gap4
.ends slot_ah_p

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- variants (2026-11-18)
.subckt slot_ah_f vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx wt=1u
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
* XPR (vr probe tap) dropped in M2 (MIL-95 item 5): XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_ah_f

* slot_cmp_h: CMP slot WITH the gap trim (nibble 6). It never routed in the 28 x 43.5 box (23 attempts, two
* comparator placements); since 2026-11-20 it is a 28 x 87 double slot (array column 3, rows 0-1).
* aux = vth_cmp (column 3). det_cmp port order: vm vth spk vbp vdd vss.
.subckt slot_cmp_h vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset t0 t1 t2 t3 wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm aux spk vbp_st vdd vss det_cmp
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
XT  la vm vbn_leak t0 t1 t2 t3 vdd vss trim_gap4
.ends slot_cmp_h

.subckt slot_ah_50 vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=3.54u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
* XPR (vr probe tap) dropped in M2 (MIL-95 item 5): XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_ah_50

.subckt slot_ah_800 vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XC2 vm vss mcap_r w=11.7u l=11.6u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_ah_800

* AH400 (M2, MIL-127 N11, 2026-11-21): as slot_ah_800 with half the extra cap (one 7.07 x 9.6 finger = the adopted 5.85 x 11.6 area,
* ~270 fF; Cm ~470 fF total). Replaces AH800 in the M2 array (row 3).
.subckt slot_ah_400 vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XC2 vm vss mcap_r w=7.07u l=9.6u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
* XPR (vr probe tap) dropped (user decision 2026-11-21 22:33 UTC, MIL-36): XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_ah_400

* REF: el, en, abus, vbn_prb, rsel, sub used; the other column lines feed through.
.subckt slot_ref rsel sub el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux vbp_syn wf=4u lf=2u
XPM el abus en rsel sub vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
.ends slot_ref

.subckt slot_dummy vm el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus vss vss vss vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus vss vss vss vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_dummy

* slot_cmp_h_notrim: CMP slot WITHOUT an in-slot gap trim (2026-11-20, option 2 of the CMP decision; the
* fallback if the double slot is dropped: nibble 6 then stays unconnected, CMP_TRIM = False). Pins = the S
* slot's set (no t0..t3). UNUSED since the CMP double slot.
.subckt slot_cmp_h_notrim vm spk rsel sub sub_b el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus vdd vss aux
+ vbp_syn sta stb hold mreset wf=4u lf=2u
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el la vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_degx
XD  vm aux spk vbp_st vdd vss det_cmp
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac wcr=3.54u wsw=1u
XPM vm abus en rsel sub_b vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XPR vr abus en rsel sub   vbn_prb vdd vss prb_tap wf={wf} lf={lf}
XS  vm vl vr sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
.ends slot_cmp_h_notrim
